  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Procurement for the project &quot;Support to Regionalisation of PSM in Ukraine&quot; - Procurement for the project &quot;Regionalisation of public service media in Ukraine&quot;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Upphandling inom projektet &#x201d;St&#xf6;d till regionaliseringen av PSM i Ukraina&#x201d;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution aims at procuring an intermediary in Ukraine who would tackle the procurement of equiment, software and technical services necessary for the implementation of the Project 11150 &quot;Support to regionalisation of public service media in Ukraine&quot; in 2018-2020. The procurement intermediary will handle all the procurement necessary for the Project 11150 in line with Sida regulations and the legislation of Ukraine.</narrative>
